  "glyph": "M10.0503 10.6066L2.97923 17.6777C2.19818 18.4587 2.19818 19.725 2.97923 20.5061V20.5061C3.76027 21.2871 5.0266 21.2871 5.80765 20.5061L12.8787 13.435 M10.0502 10.6066C9.20638 8.45358 9.37134 5.6286 11.1109 3.88909C12.8504 2.14957 16.0606 1.76777 17.8284 2.82843L14.7877 5.8691L14.5051 8.98014L17.6161 8.69753L20.6568 5.65685C21.7175 7.42462 21.3357 10.6349 19.5961 12.3744C17.8566 14.1139 15.0316 14.2789 12.8786 13.435",
